extends layout
block append css 
    link(rel='stylesheet' type="text/css" href='/static/css/aboutUs.css')

block content
    div#mission
        h1 Our Mission
        .content
            .text
                p We want to let people compete against their friends, track their progress, and make foosball even more fun. Our platform is designed to bring out the competitive spirit in everyone while helping players improve their skills. Whether you're a casual player or a foosball enthusiast, our app is here to enhance your experience. Join us and take your foosball game to the next level!

    div#story
        h1 Our Story
        .content
            .boxes
                .box
                    .name Luca
                    .nickname denkt euch gerne was aus
                .box
                    .name Paul
                    .nickname denkt euch gerne was aus
                .box
                    .name Olivia
                    .nickname denkt euch gerne was aus
            .text
                p We are three students who love to play foosball. Our competitive nature led us to create this app to find out who the best player is. What started as a fun project turned into a platform that helps others enjoy foosball as much as we do. We hope our app inspires you to play, compete, and improve!